  40:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c **** /**
  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * @brief Processing function for the Q15 FIR decimator.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * @param[in] *S points to an instance of the Q15 FIR decimator structure.
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * @param[in] *pSrc points to the block of input data.
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * @param[out] *pDst points to the location where the output result is written.
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * @param[in] blockSize number of input samples to process per call.
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * @return none.
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  *
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * <b>Scaling and Overflow Behavior:</b>
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * \par
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * The function is implemented using a 64-bit internal accumulator.
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * Both coefficients and state variables are represented in 1.15 format and multiplications yield a
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * The 2.30 intermediate results are accumulated in a 64-bit accumulator in 34.30 format.
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * There is no risk of internal overflow with this approach and the full precision of intermediate 
  54:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * After all additions have been performed, the accumulator is truncated to 34.15 format by discard
  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * Lastly, the accumulator is saturated to yield a result in 1.15 format.
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  *
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * \par
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  * Refer to the function <code>arm_fir_decimate_fast_q15()</code> for a faster but less precise imp
  59:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q15.c ****  */
